            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Average production. Chromium steel cover.\n\n# Included processes\nThis data set includes the production of a kitchen cooker hood with chromium steel cover. The production takes place in italy. Transport to a regional storage in Switzerland is included. The cooker hood has a weight of 21 kg. 60% of the material can be recycled at the end of life. The life span is approximately 15 years. The use of the cooker hood consumes 360 W/h (producer"s information). Transport to the construction site and mounting are not included.; Geography: Usage in Switzerland. Production takes place in Italy.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
